    "meta_description": "NIPT: purpose, preparation, samples and result interpretation. Ask QXL Bengaluru for current price, report time and collection.",
    "canonical_url": "https://qxldiagnostics.com/blog/nipt-cell-free-dna-prenatal-screening-bengaluru-guide",
