    "meta_description": "High-Sensitivity Troponin: purpose, preparation, samples and result interpretation. Ask QXL Bengaluru for current price, report time and collection.",
    "canonical_url": "https://qxldiagnostics.com/blog/high-sensitivity-cardiac-troponin-bengaluru-guide",
